DEVELOPMENT FAILURES AND REPAIRS (NOT COUNTED AS PASSES)
  The first helper selected a policy unsupported by an older playback helper,
    causing an uninjured fight. Replaced it with actual targeted reckless input.
  The first technical driver ran ahead without commanding its squad and died.
    It now issues the real attack command and physically retreats after a hit;
    no HP, roster, position or outcome mutations are used in these played routes.
  An added +0.125-second youth-tail corruption initially loaded. New care histories
    now require exact youth action endpoints unless a battle owns the clock.
  Early batching preflight demanded six hours of food even when two could finish;
    now it budgets actual needed hours. Interrupted time uses actual seconds.
  First whole-scene import failed on a pluralized smoke preload filename;
    fixed in 418df78, then actual main-scene and package paths passed.
  First whole regression failed two original 1280x800 strategy layout assertions;
    fixed in b71a6c9 by hiding long injury details until injuries exist. Original
    assertions stayed intact. The final full suite and affected gates were rerun.
  No Godot SCRIPT ERROR, Parse Error or ERROR markers in the final gate logs.

